#     which is the defect the argument exists to close and which this unit's
#     store makes VISIBLE for the first time by feeding progressSource.
#  3. src/components/map/MapBranchDetail.test.tsx — the same argument at the
#     fixture. (MapBranchDetail.tsx itself already passes it: the sibling unit
